  <enumValues uuid="ae5037c4-d116-4a9d-aca2-6a94a2c1b2f8">
    <name>IncludeCostOrCostDependingOnPeriod</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Include in cost while changing in the receipt period, include in other expenses in subsequent periods </value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>منظورکردن در بها در صورت تغییر در دوره دریافت، منظورکردن در سایر هزینه‌ها در دوره‌های بعدی</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Alla modifica nel periodo di versamento includere nel costo, nei periodi successivi - nelle altre spese</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>W przypadku zmiany w okresie otrzymania włączyć w koszty, w kolejnych okresach - inne wydatki</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>При изменении в периоде поступления включить в стоимость, в последующих периодах - в прочие расходы</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Giriş döneminde bir değişiklik olması durumunda maliyete, sonraki dönemlerde ise diğer giderlere dahil et</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Khi thay đổi trong thời gian nhận, bao gồm trong giá, trong các giai đoạn tiếp theo - trong các chi phí khác</value>
    </synonym>
  </enumValues>
